              "text": "Because Domino's voucher codes are highly region-specific and change frequently, the most reliable and currently active discount codes and promotions are broken down below by region. \n\n---\n\n### **\ud83c\uddee\ud83c\uddea Ireland (IE) \u2013 Current Active Codes**\nThese codes have been widely tested and verified by users across various locations in Ireland (including Dublin, Cork, Tallaght, Wexford, Kerry, and Bray):\n\n*   **`WXOHWFWI`** \u2013 **35% Off** when you spend \u20ac30 or more (widely verified to still be working).\n*   **`SPRING26`** \u2013 **35% Off** at participating stores.\n*   **Student Discount (UNiDAYS / Student Beans):** If you are a student, you can log in to your account to generate a unique **35% Off** discount code when you spend \u20ac30 or more on full-priced items.\n*   **National Promotions:** \n    *   **Two for Tuesday:** Buy one medium or large pizza, get one free (automatically applied on Tuesdays).\n    *   **2 Ben & Jerry\u2019s Tubs** for \u20ac5 (often available in the desserts/deals section).\n\n---\n\n### **\ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7 United Kingdom (UK) \u2013 Current Active Codes**\nIn the UK, the majority of Domino's coupon codes are franchise-specific and depend on your exact location. However, you can use these methods and active promotions:\n\n*   **Student Beans / UNiDAYS:** Get a unique **35% Off** code when you spend \u00a325 or more.\n*   **App \"Deal Wizard\":** If you order through the official Domino's app, add your items to your basket, and the **Deal Wizard** will automatically find and apply the best local bundle or discount code for your order.\n*   **National Deals:** \n    *   **Two for Tuesday:** Buy-one-get-one-free on medium and large pizzas.\n    *   **Price Slice:** Selected pizzas starting from \u00a310.\n*   *Tip:* Sites like *Latest Deals* host a free **Domino's Voucher Finder** tool that lets you enter your UK postcode to instantly scrape all active codes currently working at your nearest local branch.\n\n---\n\n### **\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 United States (US) \u2013 Current Active Codes**\nIf you are ordering from the US, Domino's relies heavily on national coupons rather than manual promo codes:\n\n*   **`CT120`** \u2013 Often works for a baseline discount on regular orders.\n*   **Mix & Match Deal:** Choose any two or more items (Medium 2-topping pizzas, Stuffed Cheesy Bread, Breads, Chicken, Salad, or Desserts) for **$7.99 each**.\n*   **Carryout Deal:** Get any Large 1-Topping pizza for **$7.99** when you order for carryout.\n*   **App Discount:** First-time users downloading the official Domino\u2019s app can often find a **50% off** pizza code pre-loaded on their dashboard.\n\n---\n\n### **How to Use Your Code:**\n1. Put together your order on the Domino\u2019s website or app. *(Note: Drinks and ice cream are usually excluded from the minimum spend threshold required to trigger discount codes)*.\n2. Go to your basket.\n3. Look for the box that says **\"Enter Voucher Code\"** or **\"Add Promo Code\"** at the checkout screen.\n4. Enter the code and click **Apply** to see your discount.",
